• Install and configure equipment within Edwin ( R2i ’s cloud platform) and at client sites;

• Administer and maintain servers, storage systems, telecommunications and security infrastructure;

• Monitor and analyze infrastructure performance and produce periodic reports;

• Perform infrastructure migrations and operating system and software updates;

• Install and organize cabling in a meticulous and structured manner;

• Apply data center best practices;

• Work with various technologies, including IBM Power, PowerVM, VIOS, IBM Storage, Brocade, Lenovo and Dell;

• Provide Level 2 technical support on a rotating 24/7 basis;

• Maintain the Configuration Management Database (CMDB) and Configuration Items (CIs) in accordance with ITIL practices;

• Perform administrative tasks related to CMDB and CI management;

• Prepare documentation, proposals, reports, analyses, technical specifications, estimates and other documents related to the position, obtaining approval when required;

• Share expertise across the organization as part of strategic projects;

• Perform any other related duties required by the Employer.

